    <string name="join_afscme_members_get_body"><![CDATA[Promotion of your childcare program to those looking for high-quality in-home care.<br><br>• Access to trainings and support to find the ones you need.<br>• Representation wrestling with you for your rights.<br>• MORE COMING SOON!]]></string>
