    <string name="contact_resources_title">RESOURCES FOR MEMBERS ONLY</string>
    <string name="contact_resources_text">• Sign up for <![CDATA[<a href="https://www.pillarsoforegon.org/resources/free-trainings">free trainings</a>]]> you can do at home on how to grow your program, run your business and advocate for yourself\n• Check out <![CDATA[<a href="https://www.pdx.edu/education-career-development/scholarships">scholarship funds</a>]]> for professional development including college courses\n• Your <![CDATA[<a href="https://www.afscme.org/about/governance/constitution/bill-of-rights-for-members">Provider Bill of Rights</a>]]></string>
    <string name="contact_share_text">Know other providers who would want to join PILLARS? SHARE this page with your Facebook friends.</string>
